#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:316
msgid "Set custom notification sounds for specific contacts"
msgstr "Iestatiet pielāgotas paziņojumu skaņas noteiktām kontaktpersonām"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:327
msgid "Set custom ringtones for specific contacts"
msgstr "Iestatiet pielāgotus zvana signālus noteiktiem kontaktiem"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:352
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Noklusējuma valsts kods tiek izmantots, lai formatētu skaitļus, kuros nav "
"iekļauts starptautisks prefikss (piemēram, +358).\n"
"\n"
"Ja tas ir atstāts tukšs, sistēma mēģina to automātiski noteikt no SIM kartes "
"vai tīkla.\n"
"\n"
"Šeit varat to manuāli ignorēt, ievadot 2 burtu ISO reģiona kodu (piem., ASV, "
"FI, DE) vai zvanīšanas kodu (piemēram, +358, 358, +1, 1)."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:373
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Atzvanīšanas signāls ir skaņa, kas tiek atskaņota (toot-toot-toot), gaidot "
"atbildi uz izejošo zvanu. Daži mobilo sakaru operatori to neģenerē, tāpēc "
"mums ir iespēja to ģenerēt manuāli šeit. \n"
"\n"
"Varat izvēlēties savu mūzikas failu vai notīrīt to, lai izmantotu standarta "
"sistēmas signālu."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:393
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Izvēlieties Zvana signāls"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:401
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Audio faili"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:427
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Atlasiet adrešu grāmatas, kuras izmantot kopā ar telefoniju, un sakārtojiet "
"tās prioritārā secībā. Augšējai adrešu grāmatai ir augstākā prioritāte, un "
"tā tiks dota priekšroka, ja numurs tiks atrasts vairākās adrešu grāmatās. "
"Varat izmantot tālāk esošo slēdzi Duplicate Resolver, lai palīdzētu "
"pārvaldīt dublikātus, taču pat tad, ja tas ir atspējots, ieteicams to "
"iespējot, lai nodrošinātu labāku pieredzi."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:446
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Ja tas ir iespējots, ja 5 minūšu laikā jums zvana 3 reizes ar vienu tālruņa "
"numuru, trešais zvans (un nākamie logā) liks tālrunim zvanīt ar maksimālo "
"skaļumu, apejot režīmus Klusums vai Netraucēt."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:458
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Izvēlieties kontaktpersonas, kuras vienmēr atskaņos paziņojumus pilnā "
"skaļumā, pat ja tālrunis ir režīmā Klusums vai Netraucēt."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:479
msgid "Unknown Callers"
msgstr "Nezināmi zvanītāji"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:484
msgid "Unknown Callers Action"
msgstr "Nezināmu zvanītāju darbība"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:486
msgid "Applies also to hidden numbers."
msgstr "Attiecas arī uz slēptiem numuriem."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:489
msgid "Do Nothing"
msgstr "Nedariet neko"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:490
msgid "Block Completely"
msgstr "Pilnīgi bloķēt"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:491
msgid "Silence and Hide UI"
msgstr "Apklusināt un paslēpt lietotāja interfeisu"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:492
msgid "Silence Only"
msgstr "Tikai klusums"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:500
msgid "Add Search button to InCall window and Call History for unknown callers"
msgstr ""
"Pievienojiet meklēšanas pogu InCall logam un zvanu vēsturei nezināmiem "
"zvanītājiem"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:506
msgid "Search Engine"
msgstr "Meklētājprogramma"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:510
#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:515
msgid "Custom URL"
msgstr "Pielāgots URL"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:565
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the URL you want to use for searching unknown numbers. Include "
"'{number}' in the URL where the caller's phone number should go.\n"
"\n"
"For example: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"When you tap the search button during a call, we will replace '{number}' "
"with the actual phone number and open it in your default browser."
msgstr ""
"Ievadiet URL, kuru vēlaties izmantot nezināmu numuru meklēšanai. "
"Vietrādī URL, kurā jānorāda zvanītāja tālruņa numurs, iekļaujiet "
"“{number}”.\n"
"\n"
"Piemēram: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"Kad zvana laikā pieskaraties meklēšanas pogai, mēs aizstāsim “{number}” ar "
"faktisko tālruņa numuru un atvērsim to jūsu noklusējuma pārlūkprogrammā."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:569
msgid "Custom Search URL"
msgstr "Pielāgotās meklēšanas URL"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:590
msgid "Desktop Shortcuts"
msgstr "Darbvirsmas saīsnes"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:595
msgid "Calls"
msgstr "Zvani"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:761
msgid "Name (e.g. Mom)"
msgstr "Vārds (piem., mamma)"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:811
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Šis ir zvana skaļums katrai izvadei. Līmenis tiek piemērots automātiski, kad "
"zvans tiek savienots, un ikreiz, kad zvana laikā mainās izvade, un slīdņa "
"izmaiņas ir dzirdamas uzreiz. Aparatūra līmeņus piemēro lielos soļos, un "
"klausule nekad nekļūst pilnīgi klusa. Bluetooth līmenis tiek saglabāts "
"gaidāmajam maršrutēšanas atbalstam."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:820
msgid "Decline Message"
msgstr "Noraidīt ziņojumu"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:891
msgid "System Default (Always Enabled)"
msgstr "Sistēmas noklusējums (vienmēr iespējots)"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:902
msgid "Personal Address Book"
msgstr "Personīgā adrešu grāmata"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:903
msgid ""
"This is the address book that will be synced to Andromeda if you choose to "
"do so in System Settings."
msgstr ""
"Šī ir adrešu grāmata, kas tiks sinhronizēta ar Andromeda, ja izvēlaties to "
"darīt sistēmas iestatījumos."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:911
msgid "Andromeda Contacts"
msgstr "Andromeda kontakti"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:912
msgid ""
"This is the address book that will be synced from Andromeda if you choose to "
"do so in System Settings."
msgstr ""
"Šī ir adrešu grāmata, kas tiks sinhronizēta no Andromeda, ja izvēlaties to "
"darīt sistēmas iestatījumos."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1037
msgid "Settings Saved"
msgstr "Iestatījumi saglabāti"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:40
msgid "Voice Message"
msgstr "Balss ziņa"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:91
msgid "Tap to Record"
msgstr "Pieskarieties, lai ierakstītu"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:137
msgid "Attach Voice Note"
msgstr "Pievienojiet balss piezīmi"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:224
msgid "Recording is too large for MMS (Max 600KB). Please Retake shorter."
msgstr "Ieraksts ir pārāk liels MMS (maks. 600 KB). Lūdzu, atkārtojiet īsāku."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:141
msgid "Enable Feature"
msgstr "Iespējot funkciju"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:170
msgid ""
"Contacts can trigger an action by sending a secret SMS message. Add contacts "
"below and set their secret trigger phrase."
msgstr ""
"Kontaktpersonas var aktivizēt darbību, nosūtot slepenu īsziņu. Tālāk "
"pievienojiet kontaktpersonas un iestatiet viņu slepeno palaišanas frāzi."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:173
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can request your location by sending a secret SMS message. "
"TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and set their "
"secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Uzticamās kontaktpersonas var pieprasīt jūsu atrašanās vietu, nosūtot "
"slepenu īsziņu. Lai šī funkcija darbotos, ir nepieciešams TOTP. Tālāk "
"pievienojiet kontaktpersonas un iestatiet viņu slepeno palaišanas frāzi. "
"Veidnes piemērs: 'SECRET TOTP' Reālās dzīves piemērs: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:176
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can silently trigger a callback by sending a secret SMS "
"message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and "
"set their secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Uzticamās kontaktpersonas var klusi aktivizēt atzvanīšanu, nosūtot slepenu "
"īsziņu. Lai šī funkcija darbotos, ir nepieciešams TOTP. Tālāk pievienojiet "
"kontaktpersonas un iestatiet viņu slepeno palaišanas frāzi. Veidnes piemērs: "
"'SECRET TOTP' Reālās dzīves piemērs: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:179
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can send an SMS relay. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Real life example: 'Gorilla "
"123456 +1234567890 Hello'"
msgstr ""
"Uzticamās kontaktpersonas var nosūtīt SMS retranslāciju. Lai šī funkcija "
"darbotos, ir nepieciešams TOTP. Tālāk pievienojiet kontaktpersonas un "
"iestatiet viņu slepeno palaišanas frāzi. Veidnes piemērs: 'SECRET TOTP "
"+1234567890 MESSAGE' Reālās dzīves piemērs: 'Gorilla 123456 +1234567890 "
"Hello'"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:182
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can start a tmate SSH session and receive the SSH access "
"string by sending a secret SMS message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Uzticamās kontaktpersonas var sākt tmate SSH sesiju un saņemt SSH piekļuves "
"virkni, nosūtot slepenu īsziņu. Lai šī funkcija darbotos, ir nepieciešams "
"TOTP. Tālāk pievienojiet kontaktpersonas un iestatiet viņu slepeno "
"palaišanas frāzi. Veidnes piemērs: 'SECRET TOTP' Reālās dzīves piemērs: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:185
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can wipe your device. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to "
"work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"
msgstr ""
"Uzticamās kontaktpersonas var dzēst jūsu ierīci. Lai šī funkcija darbotos, "
"ir nepieciešams TOTP. Tālāk pievienojiet kontaktpersonas un iestatiet viņu "
"slepeno palaišanas frāzi. Veidnes piemērs: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN "
"SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Reālās dzīves piemērs: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 "
"SupportYourLocalFootball'"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:284
msgid "View or edit TOTP"
msgstr "Skatīt vai rediģēt TOTP"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:286
msgid "Setup TOTP"
msgstr "Iestatīt TOTP"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:356
msgid "Secret message"
msgstr "Slepenais ziņojums"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:368
msgid "Remove Contact"
msgstr "Noņemt kontaktpersonu"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:392
msgid "Contact removed (Click Save to commit)"
msgstr ""
"Kontaktpersona ir noņemta (noklikšķiniet uz Saglabāt, lai apstiprinātu)"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:526
msgid "Contact already in trusted list"
msgstr "Kontaktpersona jau ir uzticamo personu sarakstā"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:540
msgid "Contact added"
msgstr "Kontaktpersona pievienota"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:558
msgid "TOTP Setup"
msgstr "TOTP iestatīšana"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:604
msgid ""
"Share this code with your trusted contact. They should add it to an "
"authenticator app such as Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"If entering manually, ensure the following settings:\n"
"• Algorithm: SHA1\n"
"• Digits: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 seconds\n"
"\n"
"Each action has its own code. When triggering an action by SMS, they must "
"append the current 6-digit code from their authenticator after the keyword."
msgstr ""
"Kopīgojiet šo kodu ar savu uzticamo kontaktpersonu. Viņiem tas jāpievieno "
"autentifikatora lietotnei, piemēram, Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"Ja ievadāt manuāli, pārliecinieties, vai ir šādi iestatījumi:\n"
"• Algoritms: SHA1\n"
"• Cipari: 6\n"
"• Intervāls: 60 sekundes\n"
"\n"
"Katrai darbībai ir savs kods. Aktivizējot darbību, izmantojot SMS, viņiem "
"pēc atslēgvārda ir jāpievieno pašreizējais 6 ciparu kods no sava "
"autentifikatora."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:633
